{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 20, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e4b-it", "content": "Hark gentle traveler a Japanine quest\nA journey grand to put thy soul to test.\n\n**Day One: Arrival in Tokyo's Realm**\n\nFrom distant shores thou shalt now make thy way\nTo Narita's gate where new adventures play.\nA swift train ride to Shinjuku's bright lights\nWhere towering structures pierce the darkest nights.\nA hotel awaits a haven soft and deep\nTo banish weariness and lull to sleep.\nThen wander forth through gardens green and fair\nAnd sample feasts beyond all compare.\n\n**Day Two: Tokyo's Ancient Heart**\n\nTo Asakusa's temple we shall now proceed\nWhere ancient spirits plant a hopeful seed.\nSenso-ji's grandeur a sight to behold\nWith incense smoke a story to be told.\nThen Ueno Park a haven calm and wide\nWhere museums stand with knowledge deep inside.\nPerhaps a Sumida River cruise we'll take\nAnd watch the city's beauty gently wake.\n\n**Day Three: Hakone's Volcanic Grace**\n\nA mountain journey to Hakone's shore\nWhere nature's wonders we shall now explore.\nA cruise upon Lake Ashi serene and blue\nWith views of Fuji's peak forever true.\nVolcanic hot springs a soothing balm\nTo ease thy muscles and keep thy spirit calm.\nThe Hakone Open-Air Museum we'll find\nWhere sculptures grace the landscape so refined.\n\n**Day Four: Kyoto's Imperial Splendor**\n\nBy bullet train to Kyoto we shall fly\nA city steeped in history passing by.\nFushimi Inari's gates a vibrant hue\nA thousand torii leading ever new.\nKiyomizu-dera temple perched on high\nA panoramic vista meets the eye.\nGion's district where geishas softly tread\nA glimpse of elegance before we're led.\n\n**Day Five: Kyoto's Golden Pavilion**\n\nKinkaku-ji's brilliance a golden gleam\nReflecting beauty in a tranquil dream.\nRyoan-ji's garden a puzzle to embrace\nWith stones arranged in meditative space.\nArashiyama Bamboo Grove so tall\nA verdant pathway answering nature's call.\nA tea ceremony a ritual so sweet\nA moment's pause a peaceful respite meet.\n\n**Day Six: Nara's Deer and Temples Old**\n\nTo Nara's lands where friendly deer reside\nA sacred place where ancient spirits hide.\nTodai-ji Temple houses Buddha grand\nA masterpiece of artistry at hand.\nKasuga Taisha Shrine with lanterns bright\nA pathway lit throughout the fading light.\nThen back to Kyoto memories to keep\nOf wonders witnessed while in slumber deep.\n\n**Day Seven: Departure's Sorrow**\n\nAlas the journey nears its destined end\nA fond farewell to Japan our friend.\nFrom Kansai's airport we shall take our flight\nTo distant lands bathed in morning light.\nBut memories linger of sights we've seen\nA Japanine dream forever keen.\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.009764053858816624}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -5.960462772236497e-07}, {"token": "▁gentle", "logprob": -1.326333999633789}, {"token": "▁traveler", "logprob": -0.011173651553690434}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.16809920966625214}, {"token": "▁Japan", "logprob": -0.7662087082862854}, {"token": "ine", "logprob": -1.6964117288589478}, {"token": "▁quest", "logprob": -0.28628772497177124}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -1.0659494400024414}, {"token": "A", "logprob": -0.06739963591098785}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.050089336931705475}, {"token": "▁grand", "logprob": -0.34130552411079407}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.4586891233921051}, {"token": "▁put", "logprob": -0.007011215202510357}, {"token": "▁thy", "logprob": -0.6097437739372253}, {"token": "▁soul", "logprob": -0.0002307625545654446}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.04044617712497711}, {"token": "▁test", "logprob": -8.618460560683161e-05}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.039437294006347656}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.017015893012285233}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -0.05881054699420929}, {"token": "Day", "logprob": -0.006824873387813568}, {"token": "▁One", "logprob": -0.3265781104564667}, {"token": ":", "logprob": -0.3335184454917907